  "title": "Túrós Csusza (Pasta with Cottage Cheese)",
  "description": "This túrós csusza is a traditional and comforting Hungarian pasta dish consisting of crunchy bacon, warm egg noodles, sour cream, and cottage cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Charlee"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-06-08T09:49:04-04:00",
